---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AmazonCTA from '../components/AmazonCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="D6 Storyteller Resources | Character Sheets, Dice Roller & Downloads"
  description="Free resources for D6 Storyteller: printable character sheets, Storyteller aids, an online D6 dice-pool roller, quick reference guides, errata, and links for players and Storytellers."
  canonicalUrl="https://d6storyteller.alexmerced.com/resources/"
>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="resources-heading">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb__separator" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Resources</span>
      </nav>

      <p class="section-label">Downloads & References</p>
      <h1 id="resources-heading">D6 Storyteller Resources</h1>
      <p style="color:rgba(232,224,208,0.75);margin-bottom:var(--space-8);max-width:64ch;">
        Tools and downloads to support your D6 Storyteller campaigns: an online dice-pool roller, printable character sheets, Storyteller aids, quick reference cards, and errata.
      </p>

      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2>Online Tools</h2>
        <ul class="resource-list">
          <li>
            <a href="/resources/dice-roller/"><strong>D6 Dice-Pool Roller</strong></a>
            <span>Set your pool size, roll a handful of six-sided dice, and read the single highest die. The roller highlights the deciding die and shows which outcome tier you hit  -  a play aid for running fiction-first D6 scenes at the table or online.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/resources/solo-runs/"><strong>Solo Runs  -  The Burrow Kingdoms</strong></a>
            <span>Three interactive mini-campaigns you can play alone. Step into The Burrow Kingdoms  -  a subterranean world of humanoids evolved from naked mole rats  -  pick a character, roll dice, and follow branching narrative outcomes.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2>Character Sheets</h2>
        <p>Printable character sheets for the Core Rulebook are <strong>available now</strong> on the <a href="/downloads/">Downloads page</a>  -  including the core character sheet and an optional-mechanics add-on sheet. Print-ready and free to use at your table.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:var(--space-4);"><a href="/downloads/" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Go to Downloads &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2>Storyteller Aids &amp; Quick Reference</h2>
        <p>Storyteller aids are <strong>available now</strong> on the <a href="/downloads/">Downloads page</a>, including a Storyteller quick-reference sheet and a session planner to help you prep and run scenes. All are free printable HTML aids.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:var(--space-4);"><a href="/downloads/" class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm">Browse Storyteller aids &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2>Errata</h2>
        <p>No errata have been issued for the current edition of D6 Storyteller. This page will be updated if any corrections are required. <em>Last reviewed: July 2026.</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="resource-section">
        <h2>External Links</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HC4XMKW3?binding=paperback&ref_=saga_sdp_cft_dsk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Complete D6 Storyteller Series on Amazon</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://WhoIsAlexMerced.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Alex Merced's website</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://books.alexmerced.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">books.alexmerced.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <AmazonCTA placement="resources_bottom" variant="banner" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.resource-section { margin-bottom: var(--space-10); }
.resource-section h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
.coming-soon-notice {
  background: var(--navy-800);
  border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--space-6);
  color: rgba(232,224,208,0.7);
  font-style: italic;
}
.resource-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); }
.resource-list li {
  background: var(--navy-800);
  border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
}
.resource-list li a strong { font-size: var(--text-lg); }
.resource-list li span { display: block; margin-top: var(--space-2); color: rgba(232,224,208,0.7); font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; }
.btn--sm { font-size: var(--text-sm); padding: 0.5em 1.1em; }
</style>
